### Sample requests for the Emergency Mesh backend.
### Open in IntelliJ / VS Code (REST Client extension), or paste the curl
### equivalents from README.md into Postman (Import -> Raw text).
### Server: ./gradlew bootRun --args='--spring.profiles.active=dev'

@base = http://localhost:8080

### FR-9 / FR-10: gateway uploads a message (creates an incident)
# sealedPayload = EmergencyPayload{lat 13.0827, lon 80.2707, note "Leg injury, 2 people"}
# sealed for YOUR backend key: paste the contents of secrets/sample-sealed-payload.txt
# (written by ./gradlew genKeys). A payload sealed for another key is rejected (400).
POST {{base}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: dev-gateway-key

{
  "messageId": "demo-001",
  "senderDeviceId": "phone-a",
  "gatewayDeviceId": "phone-c",
  "type": "MEDICAL",
  "timestampMs": 1790000000000,
  "ttlExpiryMs": 4102444800000,
  "hopCount": 2,
  "priorityScore": 97.5,
  "sealedPayload": "PASTE-FROM-secrets/sample-sealed-payload.txt"
}

### FR-11: list incidents (optionally ?status=PENDING&status=ACKNOWLEDGED)
GET {{base}}/api/incidents
Authorization: Basic responder responder123

### Responder teams
GET {{base}}/api/teams
Authorization: Basic responder responder123

### FR-12: assign a team (paste an incidentId from the list above)
PATCH {{base}}/api/incidents/PASTE-INCIDENT-ID/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic responder responder123

{ "teamId": "team-medical-a" }

### FR-13: update status (PENDING | ACKNOWLEDGED | RESOLVED)
PATCH {{base}}/api/incidents/PASTE-INCIDENT-ID/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic responder responder123

{ "status": "ACKNOWLEDGED" }

### HQ broadcast alert (INFO | WARNING | CRITICAL), relayed to every phone
POST {{base}}/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic responder responder123

{ "level": "WARNING", "title": "Shelter open at City School", "message": "Food, water and first aid on MG Road.", "validForMinutes": 360 }

### What a gateway fetches: signed receipts and alerts
GET {{base}}/api/notices?since=0
X-API-Key: dev-gateway-key
